It was a full moon that night.

24
00:03:19,860 --> 00:03:21,500
And there he was.

25
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:29,980
He just stood at the top of the
stairs outside my shop, silently,

26
00:03:30,340 --> 00:03:33,900
