like he was invading my heart.

27
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:40,380
Golden hair and translucent alabaster
skin, but most of all a dubious sensuality,

28
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,877
the kind you wouldn't expect from a man.

29
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:43,790
Because Mr.

30
