211
00:15:20,500 --> 00:15:22,540
But there is still hope.

212
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:26,080
It will take 50 days for her
body to reach that state.

213
00:15:26,440 --> 00:15:29,360
We just have to find and
defeat Dio before that.

214
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:34,800
If we can sever the link her stand
has with Dio, we can save her.

215
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,320
Thank you for that, Jotaro.

216
00:15:40,820 --> 00:15:43,357
I wonder what it was
that came over me today.

217
